# Course translation exports must stay importable

A collection `ImportError` fails the whole GitHub Actions `python` job. Pytest
stops at collection; the rest of the suite does not run.

`packages/shared/tests/test_course_translation_library.py` imports these names
from `aoep_shared.course_translation_batch`:

- `CourseJob`
- `split_translation_text`
- `translate_catalog`

`split_translation_text` must stay a real function in
`packages/shared/src/aoep_shared/course_translation_batch.py`. Do not delete it,
rename it, or leave the test importing a name the module does not define.
Keep partial-resume (`.partial.json` continue-on-rerun) and the dict `progress`
callback (`event`, `course_id`, `language`, `done`, `total`, `written`,
`skipped`, `failed`, `reason`).

## Before push or opening a PR

If the change touches either file above, confirm those imported names exist,
then run:

```bash
/Users/cvanthin/getschoolled/.venv/bin/python3 -m pytest packages/shared/tests/test_course_translation_library.py -q
```

The `python` job gate (a collection error fails this whole command) is:

```bash
python3 -m pytest packages/shared/tests packages/sdk/tests packages/vision-lab/tests packages/webcam-vision/tests services/*/tests apps/agent-runtime/tests apps/webcam-lab/tests training/tests scripts/tests qa/tests subrepos/theodore_webcam_lab/tests subrepos/theodore_children_webcam_lab/tests subrepos/theodore_audio_translation_lab/tests subrepos/theodore_course_studio/tests subrepos/theodore_rag_lab/tests subrepos/theodore_llm_lab/tests subrepos/theodore_drive_lab/tests subrepos/theodore_homework_lab/tests subrepos/theodore_music_lab/tests labs/*/tests -q
```

```python
